2... c6 { Offers a pawn for quick development. } 3. dxc6 { Takes it. Black gets quick development in return, so White should finish developing before worrying about the pawn. } 3... Nxc6 4. Nf3 e5 5. Bb5 { Pins the c6 knight against the king and develops. Plan: castle, and give the pawn back only when it helps development. } *
